      ],
      "still_missing": "This study provides detailed screening criteria for only one single-center cohort (1 out of the required 3 trials). It does not provide donor microbiome inclusion thresholds (e.g., diversity indices or specific genus abundance for donors), focusing instead on recipient baseline predictors. It does not compare heterogeneity across multiple trials or empirically analyze how different donor screening protocols impact efficacy consistency between studies. The link between *donor* screening specifics and clinical outcomes is asserted in the background but not tested within this study's design (donors were consistent across patients).",
